# The same late ollie as lab-ledge-late-pop with a kickflip started on it: before the ledge pop the
# skater stopped against the face mid-flip; now the arc carries on over the ledge and the kickflip has
# the air to land (it lands at 202, the flip done at 164).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 7 -6 0.13 0
cmd 6 speed 6
tap ollie 115
tap flip+left 117
run 230
expect event bump{air=true} within 124..128
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip} within 208..218
expect no event bail
